Load the files agents show in the chat through the server's chat media route.

With this deployment's server (images/server/patches/0027-chat-media-copies.patch),
GET /v1/sessions/{id}/chat-media serves a file a reply shows from the
session's sandbox while it runs, and from the server's copy once the sandbox
is asleep or gone, as after archiving. ChatMarkdownMedia asks it for the
path as the reply wrote it (decoded, without a leading ./), and the server
resolves it against the workspace, so an absolute or ~ path no longer waits
for the environment metadata, which a sleeping sandbox can't give. This
replaces 0033's fetchWorkspaceFileBlob, the filesystem route's download.

